</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7470e99e-a194-11f1-93c6-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-26T134117Z-100630411-RC2D6NA8CH3P-RTRMADP-3-NEPAL-FLOODS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7470e99e-a194-11f1-93c6-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-26T134117Z-100630411-RC2D6NA8CH3P-RTRMADP-3-NEPAL-FLOODS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">955bd734-a1e1-11f1-98ba-5b8c9d49903f</guid><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 06:36:05 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7470e99e-a194-11f1-93c6-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-26T134117Z-100630411-RC2D6NA8CH3P-RTRMADP-3-NEPAL-FLOODS.jpg">© Navesh Chitraka/Reuters</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>Former model sues French state over delay in Epstein recruiter rape investigation</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260827-former-model-sues-french-state-over-delay-in-epstein-recruiter-rape-investigation</link><description>
A former model who accused an alleged recruiter for American sex offender Jeffrey Epstein of raping her in the 1990s is suing the French state for delays to the investigation. The state is also being sued by a child protection organisation, on behalf of alleged Epstein victims.
